OL,3,GNEWSA'Murder accused hit another man
OL,4,Awith heavy blow'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was hurt in an unprovoked
OL,7,Fattack in a bar that left his friend
OL,8,Fwith fatal injuries has described the
OL,9,Fpunch feeling like being "hit with a
OL,10,Fsledgehammer", a murder trial has
OL,11,Fheard.
OL,13,FGiving evidence at Stafford Crown Court
OL,14,Fearlier, Adam Cooper, 62, who suffered
OL,15,Ffractures to his eye socket and nose,
OL,16,Fsaid there had been no warning of the
OL,17,Fevents that unfolded at the Ricco and
OL,18,FLoren bar in Lichfield, Staffordshire,
OL,19,Fon 24 May.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
