OL,3,GNEWSA'Murder accused hit another man
OL,4,Awith heavy blow'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBilly Allison, 36, of Shirley,
OL,7,FSolihull, denies murdering Matthew
OL,8,FO'Gara, 44, but has pleaded guilty to
OL,9,Fmanslaughter.
OL,11,FAllison has also admitted grievous
OL,12,Fbodily harm against Cooper, but denies
OL,13,Fthe attack was carried out with intent.
